 "intro_zh": "上海野生动物园是野生动物们的温馨家园，是大都市里的天然氧吧。这里居住着来自国内外的200余种珍稀野生动物，共计上万头，它们在此快乐生活、繁衍生息。园区分为步行区、车入区及“水域探秘”三大部分。",
 "intro_en": "Shanghai Wildlife Park is a warm home for wild animals and a natural oxygen bar in the metropolis. There are more than 200 species of rare wild animals from home and abroad, totaling tens of thousands of animals, living here happily and thriving. The park is divided into three parts: pedestrian area, vehicle entry area and \"water exploration\".",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
